WEBVTT

00:09:58.969 --> 00:10:00.763
it's not weaker, it's just different.

00:10:00.763 --> 00:10:04.433
It is, in fact, more comprehensive.
And it’s essential.”

00:10:05.768 --> 00:10:08.812
Now, of course, there are men
who do honor women, lots of them.

00:10:09.355 --> 00:10:11.982
Like my good friend
and fellow pastor Mark,

00:10:11.982 --> 00:10:15.152
who always draws out the best in me

00:10:15.194 --> 00:10:17.905
and then seems to take pleasure
in watching me lead.

00:10:18.572 --> 00:10:23.911
We need more men like Mark who are willing
to honor and empower women.

00:10:25.245 --> 00:10:28.082
I know I'm going to keep bumping
into additional differences

00:10:28.082 --> 00:10:29.291
on this journey.

00:10:29.333 --> 00:10:31.251
But let me leave you with this.